flowchart TD
    Start[Start local demo]
    Trace{LANGCHAIN_API_KEY set?}
    State[LangGraph state: messages, retry count, webhook]
    Model[ChatOllama Qwen]
    Decision{Model requests a tool?}
    Tools[ToolNode]
    Logs[read_logs: hard-coded fixture]
    Status[check_job_status: hard-coded fixture]
    Discord[post_to_discord: optional real webhook]
    Retry[Increment retry count]
    End[Return final model response]

    Start --> Trace
    Trace --> State
    State --> Model
    Model --> Decision
    Decision -->|No| End
    Decision -->|Yes| Tools
    Tools --> Logs
    Tools --> Status
    Tools --> Discord
    Logs --> Retry
    Status --> Retry
    Discord --> Retry
    Retry -->|Below limit| Model
    Retry -->|Limit reached| End
